## Work2 Boundary

Work2 includes implementation, migration and focused derivation/rendering/privacy/SSE tests, quick
changed-path validation, a scoped product commit, deployment to the configured combined
`ts.rookaro.com` target, authenticated browser and health checks, release-cohort registration,
logical checkpoint/rebuild proof, and strict Doctor.

Work2 does not push Git, tag or publish a Tool Shed version, synchronize disconnected installs, or
close IDEA-0013, MAP-0018, this PRM, or its campaign. Those remain awaiting formal Work5 release
evidence and upward reconciliation.

## Deferred Scope

- Email, paging, webhooks, and other external notification delivery.
- Remote acknowledgement, mitigation, command execution, or local-state mutation.
- Server-side maintainer visit tracking or a second event/telemetry subsystem.
